  "description": "Dedicated-thread worker and worker pool that serialize async work onto per-session background threads. Supports STA on Windows, configurable thread stack sizes, pre-thread and worker-thread lifecycle hooks, contextual and delegate session factories, typed queue-capacity admission rejections, execution deadlines, cancellation, session recycling, pluggable scheduling (IWorkerScheduler), and diagnostics via ActivitySource / Meter. Targets net11.0, net10.0, and net481/net48/net472.",
